This test contains an equilibrated solvent box containing a mixture of
different one bead solvents (W, ACN, DCE, CLF, TCM, MEO, ETO, IPO),
two bead solvents with a bond (OCT, HEX, DMSO) and benzene (a three bead
solvent with three restraints forming a triangle). It tests LJ with multiple
LJ types, simple harmonic bonds and simple triangle restraints.
